# Only the paths below have an owner, who must approve a pull request that changes them (ruleset owners): the workflows
# with the release and promote of the web image, the backend commit whose deploy/ci/ scripts those workflows run, the
# scanners' ignore files, the Makefile with its pinned tools, the pnpm supply-chain settings, the
# Renovate config and this file. Every other file has no owner, so the pull requests Renovate merges by itself (renovate.json) never touch an owned path. The last matching
# line wins.
/CODEOWNERS         @anhnvcoder
/.github/           @anhnvcoder
/.backend-commit    @anhnvcoder
/renovate.json      @anhnvcoder
/Makefile           @anhnvcoder
/pnpm-workspace.yaml @anhnvcoder
/.trivyignore.yaml  @anhnvcoder
/.grype.yaml        @anhnvcoder
